<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to {{ tenant_name }}</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;">
        <h1 style="color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">Welcome to {{ tenant_name }}!</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;">
        <p>Hi {{ user_name }},</p>
        <p>Welcome aboard! Your account has been successfully created.</p>
        <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #667eea;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong>Your Account Details:</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #666;">Email: {{ user_email }}</p>
            {% if temporary_password %}
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #666;">Temporary Password: <code style="background: #f0f0f0; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">{{ temporary_password }}</code></p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        <p>You can now log in and start using our platform.</p>
        <a href="{{ login_url }}" style="display: inline-block; background: #667eea; color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 20px;">Log In to Your Account</a>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">If you didn't request this account, please ignore this email or contact support.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #999; font-size: 12px;">
        <p>&copy; {{ current_year }} {{ tenant_name }}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
